  "agent": "HPS Real Estate",
  "text": "ROOMS TO LET – €1,250 PER MONTH PER ROOM, INCLUDING ALL UTILITY BILLS. ENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY. HPS Real Estate is delighted to present four spacious double bedrooms available to rent individually within this newly built, fully furnished four-bedroom, four-bathroom property at 4A Linn Beag. This modern property has been finished to a high standard throughout and offers comfortable, contemporary accommodation. Each bedroom benefits from its own private bathroom, providing residents with additional privacy while enjoying access to a spacious communal kitchen and dining area. Each bedroom is fully furnished and includes a double bed, bedside storage, a dedicated desk and chair, additional storage facilities and a private bathroom. The property also benefits from a bright, modern communal kitchen and dining area, complete with fitted kitchen units, appliances and dining furniture, providing residents with a comfortable shared space. The monthly rent is €1,250 per room, inclusive of all utility bills, offering residents the convenience of a fixed monthly rental cost without separate household utility charges. Key Features - €1,250 per month per room – all bills included - Four double bedrooms available to rent individually - Brand-new, fully furnished property - Each bedroom has its own private bathroom - Double bed provided in every bedroom - Dedicated study/work desk and chair in each room - Bedroom storage facilities - Modern communal kitchen and dining area - Fully fitted kitchen with appliances - Contemporary finishes throughout - Bright, spacious accommodation - Convenient fixed monthly rental cost with utilities included Accommodation Private Bedrooms Each room is furnished with a double bed, desk, chair and storage, together with the exclusive use of its own private bathroom. The accommodation is designed to offer residents privacy, comfort and convenience. Communal Areas Residents have shared use of a modern, fully equipped kitchen and dining area, providing ample space for cooking, dining and everyday living. Rent & Enquiries Monthly Rent: €1,250 per room Bills: All utility bills included in the monthly rent. Letting Arrangement: Individual rooms available within a shared four-bedroom property. ENQUIRIES BY EMAIL ONLY – PLEASE DO NOT CALL. Prospective tenants are invited to submit their enquiries by email through the property advertisement. Viewing is highly recommended to appreciate the quality of the accommodation and the benefit of having a private bathroom and all bills included within the monthly rent.",
